EXOM 2.0 brings a completely new design.
- A new Home: your week, your next workout and your progress at a glance.
- Clearer workouts, set by set, with guided rest and a big countdown on timed sets too.
- Redesigned nutrition, metrics and progress photos.
- Refreshed calendar, challenges and weekly recaps.
- More accessible with large text and reduced motion, and more reliable offline.
